@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/class-diagram

interface IAssessable
interface IResponse
interface IFeedback

hide empty members

class LtiAssessment {
    - string assessmentUrl
}
note right of LtiAssessment::assessmentUrl
    populated from result of POST line item request
end note

class LtiFeedback {
    - string normalisedMark
    - string humanReadableMark
}
note right of LtiFeedback::normalised
    populated from result of GET results request
end note
note right of LtiFeedback::humanReadableMark
    populated from result of GET results request
end note

IAssessable --|> LtiAssessment
IFeedback --|> LtiFeedback

note bottom of IResponse
    LTI results don't contain a completion state,
    thus there's no point to storing a response.
end note

@enduml
